{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19229","headline":"詶浙东李侍郎越州春晚即事长句 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶浙东李侍郎越州春晚即事长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越中蔼蔼繁华地，秦望峰前禹穴西。\n湖草初生边鴈去，山花半谢杜鹃啼。\n青油昼卷临高阁，红斾晴翻绕古堤。\n明日汉庭徵旧德，老人争出若耶溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19229.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19229","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}